---
description: Always preserve the separate clean public checkout for Story Atlas
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md and PUBLICATION.md before syncing or publishing.
Never push the daily development/data checkout or transfer its Git history.
Export committed, individually allowlisted source with `npm run prepare:public`.
Review and commit the exported diff in the separately configured public checkout.
Use its publication gate and pre-push hook; never bypass either hook or secret scanning.
Keep manuscripts, references, screenshots, backups, and credentials outside that checkout.
